  "prefLabel": "Agr 503.17 Information About Nursery Stock",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Agr 503.17 Information About Nursery Stock. The information submitted about nursery stock for sale shall include:\n\n(a) The division of plant and industry nursery license number; or\n\n(b) A statement that the plant material for sale was inspected by a plant industry division inspector on a specified date and found free of injurious insects and diseases.\n\nSource. #9616, eff 12-22-09\n\nAppendix",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/agr500.html"
